  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.steampowered.com%252fapp%252f400%252fPortal%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/w0b04gw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"619\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組重現了 Valve 熱門遊戲《传送门》中的傳送槍。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>物品：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<h4>末影珍珠粉</h4>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HIqk6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"173\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h4>迷你黑洞</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/okEMp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<h4>預設傳送槍（普通模式）</h4>\n<h4><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Aa7A.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"136\"></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>按下攻擊鍵發射藍色傳送門，使用物品鍵發射橙色傳送門。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>已過時：</strong></p>\n<p>1.10.2 與 1.12.2 版本的公告與發布詳情請見 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fichun.me%252fportal-gun-is-back-heres-whats-new-and-whats-to-come%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<p>舊版模組貼文頁面請見 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fichun.me%252fmods%252fportalgun%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>",
